h=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الِاخْتِلَافُ ، الِاسْتِغْفَارُ ، الرِّضْوَانُ ، الْمِيثَاقُ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• الِاخْتِلَافُ ، الِاسْتِغْفَارُ (Ikhtilaaf, Istighfar) → الِاخْتِلَافُ ، الِاسْتِغْفَارُ ، الرِّضْوَانُ ، الْمِيثَاقُ (Ikhtilaaf, Bakhshish maangna, Khushnoodi, Pukhta ahad).</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Unit 1 mein aasaan Qur'ani alfaaz aur buniyadi ishaare/qawa'id sikhaye gaye hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 26–27):** Is sabaq mein 36 mazeed mash'hoor Qur'ani alfaaz (`الِاخْتِلَافُ`، `الِاسْتِغْفَارُ`، `الرِّضْوَانُ`، `الْمِلَّةُ`، `الْحَسَنَةُ`) aur unki exercise aayatein di gayi hain.","hinglish_text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 1 • LESSON 7</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Sada aur Mash'hoor Qur'ani Alfaaz (Set 7 — Masadir wa Asmaa) (Page 26–27)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الِاخْتِلَافُ ، الِاسْتِغْفَارُ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Qur'ani Alfaaz (Set 7)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الِاخْتِلَافُ ، الِاسْتِغْفَارُ ، الرِّضْوَانُ ، الْمِيثَاقُ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• الِاخْتِلَافُ ، الِاسْتِغْفَارُ (Ikhtilaaf, Istighfar) → الِاخْتِلَافُ ، الِاسْتِغْفَارُ ، الرِّضْوَانُ ، الْمِيثَاقُ (Ikhtilaaf, Bakhshish maangna, Khushnoodi, Pukhta ahad).</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Unit 1 mein aasaan Qur'ani alfaaz aur buniyadi ishaare/qawa'id sikhaye gaye hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 26–27):** Is sabaq mein 36 mazeed mash'hoor Qur'ani alfaaz (`الِاخْتِلَافُ`، `الِاسْتِغْفَارُ`، `الرِّضْوَانُ`، `الْمِلَّةُ`، `الْحَسَنَةُ`) aur unki exercisei aayatein di gayi hain."}},{"id":"sec_s1l7_lbl0","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Some More Well-Known Qur'anic Words — Mazeed Mashhoor Qur'ani Alfaaz"}},{"id":"sec_s1l7_r1","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Pichle sabaqat ki tarah, iss sabaq mein bhi Quran-e-Majeed ke aasan alfaaz shamil hain jinhe aap khud samajh sakte hain. Jo alfaaz nisbatan naye hain unke maani de diye gaye hain."}}