"en":"Way / Religion / Creed","ur":"طریقہ / دین / مذہب","hi":"तरीक़ा / दीन / मज़हब"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w18","arabic":"الْوَعْد","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْوَعْد</span>","hinglish":"Waada","translations":{"en":"Promise","ur":"وعدہ","hi":"वादा"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w19","arabic":"الْعِشَاء","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعِشَاء</span>","hinglish":"Isha / Raat ka waqt","translations":{"en":"Nightfall / Late evening / Isha","ur":"عشاء / رات کا وقت","hi":"इशा / रात का वक़्त"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w20","arabic":"الْمُسْلِم","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمُسْلِم</span>","hinglish":"Musalmaan / Farmabardaar","translations":{"en":"Muslim / One who submits","ur":"مسلمان / فرماں بردار","hi":"मुसलमान / फ़रमांबरदार"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w21","arabic":"الْوَالِد","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْوَالِد</span>","hinglish":"Waalid / Baap","translations":{"en":"Father","ur":"والد / باپ","hi":"वालिद / बाप"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w22","arabic":"السُّنَّة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">السُّنَّة</span>","hinglish":"Tareeqah / Sunnat","translations":{"en":"Way / Practice / Tradition","ur":"طریقہ / سنت","hi":"तरीक़ा / सुन्नत"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w23","arabic":"آدَم","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">آدَم</span>","hinglish":"Hazrat Aadam (Alaihis Salam)","translations":{"en":"Adam (peace be upon him)","ur":"حضرت آدم علیہ السلام","hi":"हज़रत आदम (अलैहिस्सलाम)"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w24","arabic":"إِسْحَاق","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِسْحَاق</span>","hinglish":"Hazrat Ishaq (Alaihis Salam)","translations":{"en":"Isaac (peace be upon him)","ur":"حضرت اسحاق علیہ السلام","hi":"हज़रत इसहाक़ (अलैहिस्सलाम)"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w25","arabic":"الْحِكْمَة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحِكْمَة</span>","hinglish":"Hikmat / Daanaai","translations":{"en":"Wisdom","ur":"حکمت / دانائی","hi":"हिकमत / दानाई"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w26","arabic":"التَّفْصِيل","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">التَّفْصِيل</span>","hinglish":"Tafseel / Khol kar bayaan karna","translations":{"en":"Detail / Clear explanation","ur":"تفصیل / کھول کر بیان کرنا","hi":"तफ़्सील / खोल कर बयान करना"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w27","arabic":"الْحَسَنَة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَسَنَة</span>","hinglish":"Neki / Bhalai","translations":{"en":"Good deed / Virtue","ur":"نیکی / بھلائی","hi":"नेकी / भलाई"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w28","arabic":"الْمِقْدَار","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمِقْدَار</span>","hinglish":"Miqdaar / Andaazah","translations":{"en":"Measure / Quantity","ur":"مقدار / اندازہ","hi":"मिक़दार / अंदाज़ा"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w29","arabic":"الْعَابِد","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعَابِد</span>","hinglish":"Ibaadat karne wala","translations":{"en":"Worshipper / Devotee","ur":"عبادت کرنے والا","hi":"इबादत करने वाला"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w30","arabic":"الشَّاعِر","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الشَّاعِر</span>","hinglish":"Shaair / Shayeri karne wala","translations":{"en":"Poet","ur":"شاعر / شاعری کرنے والا","hi":"शायर / शायरी करने वाला"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w31","arabic":"الْعَهْد","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعَهْد</span>","hinglish":"Ahd / Pakka waada","translations":{"en":"Covenant / Pledge","ur":"عہد / پکا وعدہ","hi":"अहद / पक्का वादा"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w32","arabic":"التِّجَارَة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">التِّجَارَة</span>","hinglish":"Tijaarat / Kaarobaar","translations":{"en":"Trade / Commerce","ur":"تجارت / کاروبار","hi":"तिजारत / कारोबार"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w33","arabic":"الْمُدَّة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمُدَّة</span>","hinglish":"Muddat / Khaas waqt","translations":{"en":"Term / Fixed period","ur":"مدت / خاص وقت","hi":"मुद्दत / ख़ास वक़्त"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w34","arabic":"الْبُخْل","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبُخْل</span>","hinglish":"Bukhul / Kanjoosi","translations":{"en":"Stinginess / Miserliness","ur":"بخل / کنجوسی","hi":"बुख़्ल / कंजूसी"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w35","arabic":"الْعُمْر","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعُمْر</span>","hinglish":"Umr / Zindagi ki muddat","translations":{"en":"Life / Lifespan / Age","ur":"عمر / زندگی کی مدت","hi":"उम्र / ज़िंदगी की मुद्दत"}},{"id":"s1l7_g2_w36","arabic":"التَّكْبِير","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">التَّكْبِير</span>","hinglish":"Takbeer / Badaai bayaan karna","translations":{"en":"Takbeer / Proclaiming greatness","ur":"تکبیر / بڑائی بیان کرنا","hi":"तकबीर / बड़ाई बयान करना"}}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s1l7_r3","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Kya aapne kabhi doosre mazameen (subjects) seekhne mein itni mehnat ki hai jitni Quran seekhne mein karte hain? Nahi? Toh aaj hi se faisla karein ke apni poori mehnat aur waqt Quran ke liye lagayenge. Allah aapke saath hai."}},{"id":"sec_s1l7_r4","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Iss kitaab ki tamaam misaalein Quran-e-Kareem se hain. Kitna achha ho agar aap ise baa-wuzu hokar parhein?"}},{"id":"sec_s1l7_lbl5","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Exercise — Qur'anic Aayaat"}},{"id":"sec_s1l7_r6","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Darj zail Quranic aayaton mein se un alfaaz par ghaur karein jinhe aap mukammal taur par samajhte hain:"}},{"id":"sec_s1l7_v7","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s1l7_v7_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"وَلَا تَسْتَوِي الْحَسَنَةُ وَلَا السَّيِّئَةُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَلَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">تَسْتَوِي</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">حَسَنَةُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَلَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّيِّئَةُ</span>","hinglish":"Neki aur burai barabar nahi ho sakti.","translations":{"ur":"نیکی اور برائی برابر نہیں ہو سکتی","en":"And not equal are the good deed and the bad","hi":"नेकी और बुराई बराबर नहीं हो सकती"},"ref":"41:34"},{"id":"s1l7_v7_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"وَيُعَلِّمُهُمُ الْكِتَابَ وَالْحِكْمَةَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَيُعَلِّمُهُمُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">كِتَابَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَالْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">حِكْمَةَ</span>","hinglish":"Aur woh unhein kitaab aur hikmat sikhata hai.","translations":{"ur":"اور وہ انہیں کتاب اور حکمت سکھاتا ہے","en":"And teaches them the Book and wisdom","hi":"और वह उन्हें किताब और हिकमत सिखाता है"}},{"id":"s1l7_v7_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"وَإِمَّا تَخَافَنَّ مِنْ قَوْمٍ خِيَانَةً","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَإِمَّا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">تَخَافَنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْمٍ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خِيَانَةً</span>","hinglish":"Aur agar aapko kisi qaum se khiyaanat ka darr ho.","translations":{"ur":"اور اگر آپ کو کسی قوم سے خیانت کا ڈر ہو","en":"And if you fear from a people betrayal","hi":"और अगर आपको किसी क़ौम से ख़ियानत का डर हो"},"ref":"8:58"},{"id":"s1l7_v7_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"وَاللَّهُ ذُو الْفَضْلِ الْعَظِيمِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَاللَّهُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">ذُو</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">فَضْلِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">عَظِيمِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur Allah bade fazl wala hai.","translations":{"ur":"اور اللہ بڑے فضل والا ہے","en":"And Allah is the possessor of great bounty","hi":"और अल्लाह बड़े फ़ज़्ल वाला है"},"ref":"2:105"},{"id":"s1l7_v7_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"لَا يَسْتَوِي الْخَبِيثُ وَالطَّيِّبُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَسْتَوِي</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">خَبِيثُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَالطَّيِّبُ</span>","hinglish":"Naapaak aur paak barabar nahi ho sakte.","translations":{"ur":"ناپاک اور پاک برابر نہیں ہو سکتے","en":"Not equal are the evil and the good","hi":"नापाक और पाक बराबर नहीं हो सकते"},"ref":"5:100"},{"id":"s1l7_v7_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"إِلَّا حَاجَةً فِي نَفْسِ يَعْقُوبَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلَّا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حَاجَةً</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَفْسِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَعْقُوبَ</span>","hinglish":"Magar Hazrat Yaqoob (Alaihis Salam) ke dil mein ek zaroorat thi jo unhone poori ki.","translations":{"ur":"مگر حضرت یعقوب علیہ السلام کے دل میں ایک ضرورت تھی","en":"Except a need within the soul of Jacob","hi":"मगर हज़रत याक़ूब (अलैहिस्सलाम) के दिल में एक ज़रूरत थी"},"ref":"12:68"},{"id":"s1l7_v7_s7","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"وَمَا كَانَ اسْتِغْفَارُ إِبْرَاهِيمَ لِأَبِيهِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَمَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">كَانَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اسْتِغْفَارُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِبْرَاهِيمَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">أَبِيهِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur Hazrat Ibrahim (Alaihis Salam) ka apne baap ke liye bakhshish maangna sirf ek waade ki wajah se tha.","translations":{"ur":"اور حضرت ابراہیم علیہ السلام کا اپنے باپ کے لیے بخشش مانگنا...","en":"And the request of forgiveness of Abraham for his father was not...","hi":"और हज़रत इब्राहीम (अलैहिस्सलाम) का अपने बाप के लिए बख़्शिश माँगना..."},"ref":"9:114"},{"id":"s1l7_v7_s8","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"إِنِّي تَرَكْتُ مِلَّةَ قَوْمٍ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِاللَّهِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنِّي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">تَرَك</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ْتُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مِلَّةَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْمٍ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يُؤْمِن</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُونَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak main ne un logon ka tareeqah chhod diya jo Allah par imaan nahi rakhte.","translations":{"ur":"بیشک میں نے ان لوگوں کا طریقہ چھوڑ دیا جو اللہ پر ایمان نہیں رکھتے","en":"Indeed, I have left the religion of a people who do not believe in Allah","hi":"बेशक मैंने उन लोगों का तरीक़ा छोड़ दिया जो अल्लाह पर ईमान नहीं रखते"},"ref":"12:37"},{"id":"s1l7_v7_s9","sentence_number":9,"arabic":"وَاخْتِلَافِ اللَّيْلِ وَالنَّهَارِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَاخْتِلَافِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّيْلِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَالنَّهَارِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur raat aur din ke badalne mein.","translations":{"ur":"اور رات اور دن کے بدلنے میں","en":"And the alternation of the night and the day","hi":"और रात और दिन के बदलने में"}},{"id":"s1l7_v7_s10","sentence_number":10,"arabic":"وَمَنْ كَانَ فَقِيرًا فَلْيَأْكُلْ بِالْمَعْرُوفِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَمَنْ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">كَانَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فَقِيرًا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فَلْيَأْكُلْ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">بِالْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">مَعْرُوفِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur jo zarooratmand ho toh woh dastoor ke mutabiq khaa le.","translations":{"ur":"اور جو ضرورت مند ہو تو وہ دستور کے مطابق کھا لے","en":"And whoever is poor — let him take according to what is acceptable","hi":"और जो ज़रूरतमंद हो तो वह दस्तूर के मुताबिक़ खा ले"},"ref":"4:6"},{"id":"s1l7_v7_s11","sentence_number":11,"arabic":"لَا تُضَارَّ وَالِدَةٌ بِوَلَدِهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">تُضَارَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَالِدَةٌ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">وَلَدِهَا</span>","hinglish":"Kisi maa ko uske bachche ki wajah se takleef na di jaye.","translations":{"ur":"کسی ماں کو اس کے بچے کی وجہ سے تکلیف نہ دی جائے","en":"No mother should be harmed through her child","hi":"किसी माँ को उसके बच्चे की वजह से तकलीफ़ न दी जाए"},"ref":"2:233"},{"id":"s1l7_v7_s12","sentence_number":12,"arabic":"وَيَقُولُونَ مَتَىٰ هَذَا الْوَعْدُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَيَقُول</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُونَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَتَىٰ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَذَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">وَعْدُ</span>","hinglish":"Aur woh kehte hain ke yeh waada kab poora hoga?","translations":{"ur":"اور وہ کہتے ہیں کہ یہ وعدہ کب پورا ہوگا؟","en":"And they say, 'When is this promise?'","hi":"और वे कहते हैं कि यह वादा कब पूरा होगा?"},"ref":"10:48"}],"cols":3}}]}}